// The 9P2000 messages (docs/02 §3): name, type number, and fields in wire
// order. The codec, the message names and the server's dispatch all expand
// from this table. 9Px's extensions add rows when their first user lands
// (02 §3.3). Terror (106) does not exist.

P9_MSG(Tversion, 100, P9F_MSIZE, P9F_VERSION)
P9_MSG(Rversion, 101, P9F_MSIZE, P9F_VERSION)
